---
title: "C06 — Refresh rotation and replay · Implemented"
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Browser transport
  participant A as Auth API
  participant D as Session storage
  B->>A: Request with expired access token
  A-->>B: 401
  B->>B: Coordinate one refresh
  B->>A: Refresh using cookie
  A->>D: Lock and validate credential
  alt Valid unused credential
    D->>D: Rotate credential atomically
    A-->>B: New cookie and access JWT
    B->>A: Retry original request once
  else Reused or invalid credential
    D->>D: Revoke family when reuse is detected
    A-->>B: 401
    B->>B: Clear session and scoped state
  end
  Note over B,A: 403 does not trigger refresh
